sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Service Officer
  participant App as CampusServiceApp
  participant Mgr as ServiceRequestManager
  participant Req as ServiceRequest (subclass)
  participant DS as CampusDataStore

  O->>App: Option 10 "Service Officer Workspace", ID OFF001
  App->>Mgr: findUserById("OFF001")
  Mgr-->>App: ServiceOfficer (canManageRequests() = true)
  O->>App: 2 "Review a request" REQ008
  App->>Mgr: reviewRequest("REQ008", "OFF001", comment)
  Mgr->>Mgr: requireOfficer(actor)
  Mgr->>Req: review(actor, comment)
  Req->>Req: changeStatus(Reviewed): Submitted -> Reviewed allowed, add history
  Mgr->>DS: save requests + audit
  O->>App: 4 "Assign a Technician" REQ008
  App->>Mgr: getUsersByType("Technician")
  App->>O: list technicians and open jobs
  O->>App: TECH002, instructions
  App->>Mgr: assignTechnician("REQ008", "OFF001", "TECH002", comment)
  Mgr->>Mgr: requireOfficer(actor)
  Mgr->>Mgr: findUserById("TECH002").canWorkOnRequests()
  alt not an officer / not a technician / wrong status
    Mgr->>Mgr: addAudit(outcome "Rejected") (permission or workflow errors)
    Mgr-->>App: PermissionError / ValidationError / WorkflowError
    App->>O: [ERROR] message
  else allowed
    Mgr->>Req: assignTechnician("TECH002", actor, comment)
    Req->>Req: changeStatus(Assigned): Reviewed -> Assigned allowed, add history
    Mgr->>Mgr: addAudit("Technician Assigned", "Success")
    Mgr->>DS: saveRequests() and saveAudit()
    App->>O: [OK] REQ008 assigned to TECH002. Status: Assigned
  end
